description: Storefront UI — CSS Modules + Motion, not Tailwind isolation
globs: Client/src/components/{home,layout,sections,tradein}/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# MAZE storefront styling

- Home shell and sections use **CSS Modules** (`*.module.css`) + brand tokens in `Client/src/styles/tokens.css`.
- Do **not** style new home UI with Tailwind utility class isolation.
- Animations: `motion/react` (`import { motion, AnimatePresence } from "motion/react"`).
- Shared typography helpers: `.maze-overline`, `.maze-display-xl`, `.maze-display-lg`, `.maze-heading-1`, `.maze-heading-2`, `.maze-wordmark`.
- Catalog / product / cart / admin may still use Tailwind until a later pass.
